{
 "brief": "Al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released a new video documenting field commander Muhammad al-Barai's responsibilities in mobilization, strategic guidance, and oversight of fighters, Shehab Wire reported. The footage was distributed through the group's specialized channel as part of its \"Storm Stars\" documentary series, which records the activities and contributions of operational leaders.\n\nThe video presentation underscores al-Barai's position within the armed faction's command hierarchy. It details his work coordinating personnel and maintaining morale among combatants described in the material as \"the elite of the guardians.\" The release forms part of Al-Qassam's broader effort to document leadership roles during the ongoing conflict.",
